<div class="mandarin-hanzi">老师</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">lǎoshī</div>

''Meaning:'' teacher; respectful form of address for a teacher  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
老师今天很忙。 — Lǎoshī jīntiān hěn máng. — The teacher is busy today.

!! Usage note
Noun for 'teacher', also used as a form of address, as in 张老师 (Zhāng lǎoshī, 'Teacher Zhang').
